{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-5-1","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：整数","englishTitle":"If there be any number of magnitudes whatever which are, respectively, equimultiples of any magnitudes equal in multitude, then, whatever multiple one of the magnitudes is of one, that multiple also will all be of all.","book":5,"number":1,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.1","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.1/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":1,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-5-1@raw-1287c2fa146b5a65","contentId":"euclid-5-1","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1287c2fa146b5a6503970adae5191f8d76bd654b8b78960313e2e3492f2403bc","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-5-1.statement","euclid-5-1.construction.1","euclid-5-1.proof.1","euclid-5-1.construction.2","euclid-5-1.proof.2","euclid-5-1.proof.3","euclid-5-1.proof.4","euclid-5-1.conclusion","euclid-5-1.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-5-1.statement","contentId":"euclid-5-1","revisionId":"euclid-5-1@raw-1287c2fa146b5a65","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b20f167aa346ec7cce32ffbc0340e636a0efa9181e282fb40c28675fa70b102e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If there be any number of magnitudes whatever which are, respectively, equimultiples of any magnitudes equal in multitude, then, whatever multiple one of the magnitudes is of one, that multiple also will all be of all."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果有数量 任何数量 分别为 同倍数 的 任何数量 数量 的 数量, 数量, 那么, 不论 多个数量 的 数量是 一个, 倍数 也 全部 。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-1.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-5-1","revisionId":"euclid-5-1@raw-1287c2fa146b5a65","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"aa872bd25756ad923be429de78dc413e4122020fe874389b66079344a4ea0917","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let any number of magnitudes whatever AB, CD be respectively equimultiples of any magnitudes E, F equal in multitude; I say that, whatever multiple AB is of E, that multiple will AB, CD also be of E, F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"任何数量,无论AB,CD, 都得是E,F等量的同倍数;我说,无论多重AB是E, 倍数AB, CD也是E, F。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-1.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-5-1","revisionId":"euclid-5-1@raw-1287c2fa146b5a65","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3897b943fa53659fb349bd46445cacf91a195822310150fe37d79642f58c84a8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since AB is the same multiple of E that CD is of F, as many magnitudes as there are in AB equal to E, so many also are there in CD equal to F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为AB是E的乘数,CD是F,AB的乘数与AB等于E的乘数相同,CD等于F的乘数也相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-1.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-5-1","revisionId":"euclid-5-1@raw-1287c2fa146b5a65","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"40851241af4eed9d3dc5c6577e0301248e29902eeae71ab57ba9dca2d9094ab7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be divided into the magnitudes AG, GB equal to E, and CD into CH, HD equal to F; then the multitude of the magnitudes AG, GB will be equal to the multitude of the magnitudes CH, HD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB分为AG、GB等于E,CD分为CH,HD等于F;那么,AG、GB的数量将等于CH、HD等量的数量。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-1.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-5-1","revisionId":"euclid-5-1@raw-1287c2fa146b5a65","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b7bbb43fa0686c1177c6bb8e8c3af2e2e86207f12971028c8abc0bcecd0bc213","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since AG is equal to E, and CH to F, therefore AG is equal to E, and AG, CH to E, F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,AG等于E,CH至F,AG等于E,AG等于AG,CH至E。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-1.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-5-1","revisionId":"euclid-5-1@raw-1287c2fa146b5a65","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"aabf26c2c268625f07525d3f8a0bb36c2ada0b846bc1fc7c8d727df8fa8156e5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"也因为同样的原因"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-1.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-5-1","revisionId":"euclid-5-1@raw-1287c2fa146b5a65","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d564e686ca28cccba30de87f3dfa2ec77eff15f3c58a3696ed1ae848e905f746","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"GB is equal to E, and GB, HD to E, F; therefore, as many magnitudes as there are in AB equal to E, so many also are there in AB, CD equal to E, F; therefore, whatever multiple AB is of E, that multiple will AB, CD also be of E, F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"GB等于E,GB,HD至E,F;因此,AB等于E的音量,AB等于E,CD等于E,F;因此,无论AB是E,AB乘以AB,CD乘以E,F,AB乘以AB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-1.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-5-1","revisionId":"euclid-5-1@raw-1287c2fa146b5a65","order":7,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-1.source","contentId":"euclid-5-1","revisionId":"euclid-5-1@raw-1287c2fa146b5a65","order":8,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ec56dd6b761a3fe7d3e64c802352fbdd531db5dced94e292c1a4841b29305ef8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.1/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.1\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-5-5:euclid-5-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5-5","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-5-5.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.5","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.5/","sourceLabel":"V. 1"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-5-8:euclid-5-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5-8","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-5-8.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"expli